		"en": [
			"• Dreissen is made into HGUC in \"Mobile Suit GundamZZ\" version.",
			"• Dreissen features a variety of weapons and the proportions typical of a heavy MS are reproduced with a modern design.",
			"• The designs on the sleeves and chest are reproduced with new modeling.",
			"• The three-shot cannon on the arm can also be recreated with replacement parts.",
			"• Comes with a tri-blade, beam lancer, and a variety of other weapons.",
